{"version":1,"content":"<p>美國正調查伊朗是否參與針對全球能源運輸船隻的一系列網絡攻擊。根據《華爾街日報》11月23日的報道，美國官員認為，近期最多可能有50艘商船成為攻擊目標。這些船隻運輸的貨物包括原油、液化石油氣、化學品以及其他具有潛在危險性的物質。部分船隻還收到爆炸威脅、勒索要求，或警告其不得運輸美國相關產品的信息。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1587764.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-24T03:03:56.195579+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":153,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-24T02:50:57+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-24T02:57:14.843404+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-24T02:57:14.843404+00:00","content_hash":"0b0a9aa22205851ffa8b20587a272ed224ed99e0aefcc948cd5f08cef8ca1791","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}